  (text "Raspberry Pi Pico (RP2040) and the I2C bus" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 33.02 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54) (thickness 0.508) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "36be7da1-726f-5b53-a2fd-1e6da4c339fa"))
  (text "U301 plugs in on headers. All 26 header GPIOs are used; further controls go on I2C. Flags lead to sheets 4-9." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 40.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "dcf8680c-70af-5719-bf0e-0d382a08ade9"))
  (text "VBUS (pin 40) and 3V3 (pin 36) are the board's 5 V and 3.3 V sources (power-output pins); sheet 2 has the budget." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 43.18 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6db623c8-27df-570b-9683-33ebf18bbdd7"))
  (text "I2C0 400 kHz: 0x20 + 0x24 step buttons, 0x21 step LEDs" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 76.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f1bcced7-0a94-534c-8133-2f2073806cd3"))
  (text "(sheet 7), 0x22 + 0x23 key scanner (sheet 10) for the" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 78.74 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7ccdd49e-7bbb-582a-9eda-939474157d8d"))
  (text "key matrix (sheet 8)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 81.28 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "78e4186d-70a4-5b57-af10-c6b97374679d"))
  (text "R301/R302: external pull-ups, the firmware turns the" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 83.82 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "79896c28-faba-5914-8a04-8b286778c26a"))
  (text "internal ones off. 2.2 k suits up to ~150 pF; fit up" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 86.36 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b94e39ae-c83a-5b2f-8409-8abca3cc6ffd"))
  (text "to 4.7 k when the measured bus allows it." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 88.9 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6a7be41e-62aa-567d-882a-752c9d85c1e4"))
  (text "TP301 (JITTER, on GPIO 7): high while the sequencer timer ISR runs (JITTER_MEASUREMENT.md); TP302 is the probe ground." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 165.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9c7b7e78-a46f-5684-81a0-41e4ac418349"))
  (text "GPIO 7 also reaches JP201 (sheet 2): bridged 2-3 instead of 1-2, it switches the LED rail and is no longer the jitter probe." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 167.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "674c1d2a-538b-5367-af30-0a63e6d25e40"))
  (text "Left open on purpose: RUN and 3V3_EN (pulled up on the Pico), VSYS (5 V comes from VBUS)," (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 170.18 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "cfc94a13-6bb1-510a-935f-b38df016ddfe"))
  (text "ADC_VREF (GPIO 26-28 are digital here). R303 0 R joins AGND to GND at one point. GPIO 25 (on-board LED) is not on the header." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 172.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c3b5cb12-b9f8-5051-9f54-56f859af8e31"))
